 discussions of both the utility and the aesthetic appeal of each of the buildings they consider.", "details": [{"n": 1, "text": "Those books ought to include discussions."}, {"n": 2, "text": "There are two things to discuss."}, {"n": 3, "text": "One is the utility of the buildings."}, {"n": 4, "text": "The other is their aesthetic appeal."}, {"n": 5, "text": "This applies to each building the book considers."}]}, {"n": 3, "text": "If they do not, they are flawed.", "details": [{"n": 1, "text": "This is a conditional statement."}, {"n": 2, "text": "The condition is a book not doing that."}, {"n": 3, "text": "Such a book is flawed."}]}, {"n": 4, "text": "Morton’s book on Italian Baroque palaces describes these palaces’ functional aspects,", "details": [{"n": 1, "text": "This is about a book by Morton."}, {"n": 2, "text": "The book is on Italian Baroque palaces."}, {"n": 3, "text": "The book describes something."}, {"n": 4, "text": "What it describes is the palaces'' functional aspects."}]}, {"n": 5, "text": "but fails to mention that the main hall of a palace he discusses at length has a ceiling that is one of the truly breathtaking masterpieces of Western art.", "details": [{"n": 1, "text": "This is a contrast with what the book does."}, {"n": 2, "text": "The book fails to mention something."}, {"n": 3, "text": "It is about the main hall of a palace."}, {"n": 4, "text": "Morton discusses that palace at length."}, {"n": 5, "text": "The hall has a ceiling."}, {"n": 6, "text": "The ceiling is one of the masterpieces of Western art."}, {"n": 7, "text": "It is described as truly breathtaking."}]}], "the_read": "If Morton''s book is intended for a general audience, then it is flawed.", "the_read_type": "I", "questions": [{"citation": "PT21.S3.Q6", "qnum": 6, "question_type": "Necessary Assumption", "correct_answer": "C"}]}, {"order": 7, "slug": "PT21_S3_Q7", "prompt": "Of all the photographs taken of him at his wedding, there was one that John and his friends sharply disa