ower the value of nearby land that they own.", "credited_answers": [], "cumulative_after": [], "explanation": "The details your recall has to carry, by chunk: (1) The mayor is the speaker. · A protest was held. · The protest was huge. · It was held yesterday. · The protest was against plans. · The plans are to build a chemical plant. · The plant would be in this town. (2) This is about the protesters. · The protesters make a claim. · Their claim is that the factory could cause problems. · The problems would be health problems. (3) This is a contrast with the protesters. · The protesters'' claim is a worry. · That worry can be dismissed. (4) This is about most of the protesters. · They were there for one reason only. · The reason is that they were paid to show up. · Property developers paid them. · Those developers are concerned about something. · Their concern is that the factory would lower land value. · The land is nearby. · The developers own that land.", "category": "Classic Flaw", "chunks": [{"n": 1, "text": "Mayor: A huge protest against plans to build a chemical plant in this town was held yesterday.", "details": [{"n": 1, "text": "The mayor is the speaker."}, {"n": 2, "text": "A protest was held."}, {"n": 3, "text": "The protest was huge."}, {"n": 4, "text": "It was held yesterday."}, {"n": 5, "text": "The protest was against plans."}, {"n": 6, "text": "The plans are to build a chemical plant."}, {"n": 7, "text": "The plant would be in this town."}]}, {"n": 2, "text": "The protesters claim that the factory could cause health problems.", "details": [{"n": 1, "text": "This is about the protesters."}, {"n": 2, "text": "The protesters make a claim."}, {"n": 3, "text": "Their claim is that the factory could cause problems."}, {"n": 4, "text": "The problems would be health problems."}]}, {"n": 3, "text": "But this worry can be dismissed.", "details": [{"n": 1, "text": "This is a contrast with the protesters."}, {"n": 2, "text": "The protesters'' claim is a worry."